- op: discuss  # d550
  at: '2026-06-09T18:34:01Z'  # d550
  by: agent  # d550
  actor: jgstern_agent  # d550
  clock: 2  # d550
  nonce: d550  # d550
  message: "Vocabulary-staleness flag (2026-06-09): this family's must-carry field list (stable_id, canonical_name, path, language, origin, origin_run_id, fingerprint) was written 2026-06-08 against a pre-ADR-0031/0032 Symbol model and is now partly stale. (1) canonical_name was REMOVED by ADR-0032 (split into display_label + qualified_name); member WI-fozoh's title also references it. (2) language was relaxed to Optional[str] by ADR-0031 and is legitimately None on synthetic stand-ins (they carry discovery_language); member WI-kufib's language-null is BY DESIGN, not a stamping defect — see the WI-kufib triage note. The genuinely-must-be-non-null fields the stamping step should guarantee are: stable_id, discovery_language, qualified_name/display_label, path, origin, origin_run_id, fingerprint, and a correct id kind-slot. Recommend re-syncing this statement to that vocabulary before implementing the stamping fix, so the family does not chase dead or by-design-null fields."  # d550
